    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/f73e056510f5d886d93383db6d838d87.avif?t=1703746811\" /></div><br>The aliens lived in relative peace in their part of space until humans invented faster-than-light travel. The humans occupied the mother planet and the surrounding ufok space stations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn-based combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Lead a team of aliens in ferocious turn-based clashes filled with lasers. Use your position and cover to dispose of enemies and keep your aliens alive. Upgrade your gear and equipment between clashes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique skills and items</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use alien skills to get rid of enemies faster. Use grenades, poison and other unusual items, or shoot them with your laser gun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infiltration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get through security to steal people's data. Complete the mission quietly without alerting any enemies or firing a single shot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music</h2>Breathtaking paranormal music composed by Pawel Blaszczak, creator of the music for such games as The Witcher 3: Wild Game and Dying Light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Science fiction in the old style.<br></li><li>Over 20 different weapons.<br></li><li>Over 30 types of skills and implants.<br></li><li>Over 20 diverse planets.<br></li><li>Control a group of 1 - 5 aliens who have had their pralettes taken away.<br></li><li>Defeat hundreds of human opponents.<br></li><li>Take opponents prisoner to obtain additional information.<br></li><li>Carry out reconnaissance missions to enemy bases and steal technology.<br></li><li>Intimidate your opponents to take them out of the battle.<br></li><li>Explore the space map for more missions.<br></li><li>Build up your spaceship and upgrade your team with new implants.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/f73e056510f5d886d93383db6d838d87.avif?t=1703746811\" /></div><br>The aliens lived in relative peace in their part of space until humans invented faster-than-light travel. The humans occupied the mother planet and the surrounding ufok space stations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn-based combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4bb65de4e397f3d381466e1eff3b526c.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Lead a team of aliens in ferocious turn-based clashes filled with lasers. Use your position and cover to dispose of enemies and keep your aliens alive. Upgrade your gear and equipment between clashes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique skills and items</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/014973cc640e50543d9ec0149ceaf81b.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use alien skills to get rid of enemies faster. Use grenades, poison and other unusual items, or shoot them with your laser gun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infiltration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.poster.avif?t=1703746811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.webm?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930830/extras/4c79036f4f3cd737ce52917666a92f2d.mp4?t=1703746811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get through security to steal people's data. Complete the mission quietly without alerting any enemies or firing a single shot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music</h2>Breathtaking paranormal music composed by Pawel Blaszczak, creator of the music for such games as The Witcher 3: Wild Game and Dying Light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Science fiction in the old style.<br></li><li>Over 20 different weapons.<br></li><li>Over 30 types of skills and implants.<br></li><li>Over 20 diverse planets.<br></li><li>Control a group of 1 - 5 aliens who have had their pralettes taken away.<br></li><li>Defeat hundreds of human opponents.<br></li><li>Take opponents prisoner to obtain additional information.<br></li><li>Carry out reconnaissance missions to enemy bases and steal technology.<br></li><li>Intimidate your opponents to take them out of the battle.<br></li><li>Explore the space map for more missions.<br></li><li>Build up your spaceship and upgrade your team with new implants.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "These damned people have been reigning in our part of space for too long. They kidnap our people and conduct experiments on them. We cannot afford to be treated like this.",
